<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28129" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δορύ̆φορ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spear-bearing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀπάονες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					769
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., <i>spearman,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.2.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> esp. <i>one
				of the body-guard</i> of kings and tyrants, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.59
			</span></i>, etc.; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ Περίανδρος] πρῶτος -φόρους ἔσχε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					516
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> at Rome, of
				<i>the praetorians,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Galb.</u>
				13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				5.4.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδοναὶ δ.</span>
			<i>mere satellite</i> pleasures, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				587c
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				573e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τῶν ἐπιθυμιῶν τινος</span>
			<i>pandering to</i> his lusts, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tyr.</u>
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> in Drama,
				<i>mute character,</i>
			<i><span class="en">Hsch.,
				<u>EM</u>284.21</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
